    <string name="discovery_notice_body" formatted="false">"Cablegram is signed in to Telegram on this phone, like Telegram Desktop. It looks at your chats here, on this phone. Chat names, counts, messages and thumbnails are never sent to Cablegram's servers. Only the videos you add go into “Cablegram library”."</string>
