    <string name="how_title" formatted="false">"How this works"</string>
    <string name="how_body" formatted="false">"Cablegram is signed in to Telegram on this phone, like Telegram Desktop. The code that looks at your chats lives in one place, the app.cablegram.discovery package of the phone app, and the app's open-source test (TelegramApiSurfaceTest) lists every Telegram call it is allowed to make. Chat names, counts, messages and thumbnails stay on this phone. Only the videos you add are forwarded into \"Cablegram library\"."</string>
